{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":20,"ref":"judges 7:20","book":"judges","lang":"de","chapter":7,"translation":"Und die drei Abteilungen stießen in die Schofarot und zerbrachen die Krüge. Sie hielten in ihrer linken Hand die Fackeln und in ihrer rechten Hand die Schofarot, um zu stoßen, und riefen: „Ein Schwert für JHWH und für Gid'on!“","tokens":[{"surface":"ויתקעו","gloss":"Und sie stießen"},{"surface":"שלשת","gloss":"die drei"},{"surface":"הראשים","gloss":"Abteilungen"},{"surface":"בשופרות","gloss":"in die Schofarot"},{"surface":"וישברו","gloss":"und zerbrachen"},{"surface":"הכדים","gloss":"die Krüge"},{"surface":"ויחזיקו","gloss":"Sie hielten"},{"surface":"ביד","gloss":"in ⟨ihrer⟩ Hand"},{"surface":"שמאולם","gloss":"links"},{"surface":"בלפדים","gloss":"die Fackeln"},{"surface":"וביד","gloss":"und in ⟨ihrer⟩ Hand"},{"surface":"ימינם","gloss":"rechts"},{"surface":"השופרות","gloss":"die Schofarot"},{"surface":"לתקוע","gloss":"um zu stoßen"},{"surface":"ויקראו","gloss":"und riefen"},{"surface":"חרב","gloss":"„Ein Schwert"},{"surface":"ליהוה","gloss":"für JHWH"},{"surface":"ולגדעון","gloss":"und für Gid'on!“"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-06T22:35:25.085433913Z","model":"glm-5.2"}